Contract between the City of Cheyenne and Laramie County School District No. 1 for school
resource officers for the 2009-2010 school year.  Mr. Valdez moved to approve in an amount not to
exceed $339,494.00, seconded by Ms. Broyles.  Mr. Valdez moved to amend paragraph #12(a) by
